  "title": "Creamy She-Crab Soup",
  "description": "White crab meat and crab roe are incorporated into this mace and Worcestershire sauce seasoned bisque. Serve with a tablespoon of sherry and a dollop of whipped cream.",
  "authors": [
    "MARBALET"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-03-30T12:44:11-05:00",
